  badImage[400 for type signature or size]
  tooBig[Body over 48 MiB is not sent]
  failed[A transport failure stores no usage row]
  seam[A later job reserves a staged row then stores bytes]
  pending[Terminal commit marks ready pending_delete and staged tombstone]
  purge[After commit delete bytes then drop only a pending_delete row]
  retry[The beat deletes pending_delete and tombstone bytes]
